# PROJECT: Deepsmoke Star

## STATUS
Active

## CURRENT STATE
Deepsmoke Star is a rich, first-person voxel co-op drilling survival game featuring procedurally generated biomes, real-time weather and lighting cycles, and a custom steam-hauler logistics loop.

## CURRENT FOCUS
Improving the co-op multiplayer systems (Star Multiplayer SDK) to support full synchronization of block placements, chest inventories, and hauler/dock states.

## NEXT ACTION
Implement action handlers and sync logic for block placement and chest storage containers across multiplayer sessions.

## BLOCKERS
- Block placement and chest inventories are currently local-only and not synchronized across network clients.

## RECENT CHANGE
Expanded the world scale 8x vertically, introduced procedural biome bands (mountains, deserts, valleys, buttes) and floating islands, and implemented a camp steam-hauler automation system.

## OUTPUT ARTIFACTS
- `index.html` (Pixelify Sans, custom brass & cobalt panel UI, canvas settings)
- JavaScript modules (`main.js`, `coop.js`, `gamepad.js`, `hotbar.js`, `hud.js`, `input.js`, `inventory.js`, `items.js`, `mobs.js`, `npcs.js`, `partner.js`, `player.js`, `textures.js`, `trees.js`, `ui.js`, `upgrades.js`, `world.js`)
