## RELATED SYSTEMS
- **Three.js** (v0.160 WebGL 3D rendering)
- **Star Multiplayer SDK** (Real-time client synchronization)
- **Star Audio SDK** (Directional sound and score effects)
- **Star Leaderboard SDK** (Global and run-based high scores)
- **Tailwind CSS** (Fast-styled layouts and HUD components)

